flowchart TB
  accTitle: How the assistant reads the text of an issue
  accDescr: The text of an issue or a comment, which anyone can write, is read up to GitHub's 65,536 characters. The answers of a form are cut out between their headings, which are found once; from them come the labels of the form and the reporter's language. For the AI, the HTML goes first, comments and tags in one pass, then the link reference definitions and the footnotes without a reference, which GitHub shows as nothing as well, each with a note in its place, for issue.md and for an excerpt of each other issue, whose form answers then become lines. Then the characters that GitHub shows as nothing go, in one pass, after the HTML, so that none can end an HTML comment that GitHub never ends. The excerpts go into issues.jsonl, and issue.md holds up to 20,000 characters of each text in a code fence that the text can't close.
  text["issue or comment text,<br>which anyone writes"] --> cap["at most 65,536 characters,<br>as much as GitHub keeps"]
  cap --> forms["`**form_fields**<br>each heading found once,<br>answers cut out between`"]
  forms --> event["labels of the form,<br>the reporter's language"]
  cap --> html["`**strip_html**<br>comments and tags<br>in one pass`"]
  html --> definitions["`**strip_definitions**<br>link definitions and<br>footnotes without a<br>reference out, a note<br>in the place of each`"]
  definitions --> excerpt["`**excerpt** of every<br>other issue: without HTML,<br>form answers as lines`"]
  definitions --> visible["`**Visible**<br>invisible characters<br>out, in one pass`"]
  excerpt --> visible
  visible -- "the other issues" --> jsonl["`**issues.jsonl**,<br>an excerpt of each`"]
  visible -- "the issue" --> issue["`**issue.md**, up to 20,000<br>characters of each text,<br>each in its own fence`"]
  classDef untrusted fill:#cf222e26,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:2px
  classDef job fill:#8c959f1f,stroke:#8c959f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef safe fill:#1a7f3726,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:2px
  class text untrusted
  class cap,forms,excerpt,html,definitions,visible job
  class event,jsonl,issue safe
